ications","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Useful additional learning areas include:"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical"},{"type":"h","text":"Basic life support/emergency response"},{"type":"h","text":"Infection control"},{"type":"h","text":"Dental radiography"},{"type":"h","text":"Endodontic fundamentals"},{"type":"h","text":"Oral surgery"},{"type":"h","text":"Periodontal care"},{"type":"h","text":"Pediatric dentistry"},{"type":"h","text":"Public Health"},{"type":"h","text":"Epidemiology"},{"type":"h","text":"Biostatistics"},{"type":"h","text":"Community medicine"},{"type":"h","text":"Health-program management"},{"type":"h","text":"Health education"},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"h","text":"Digital dentistry"},{"type":"h","text":"Dental imaging"},{"type":"h","text":"Electronic health records"},{"type":"h","text":"Healthcare analytics"},{"type":"h","text":"AI in healthcare"},{"type":"h","text":"Professional"},{"type":"h","text":"Medical/dental ethics"},{"type":"h","text":"Communication skills"},{"type":"h","text":"Research methodology"},{"type":"h","text":"Scientific writing"},{"type":"h","text":"Evidence-based dentistry"},{"type":"p","text":"Certification value depends on whether the training is recognized and relevant to the intended role."}]},{"heading":"PG Options","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"MDS Specializations"},{"type":"p","text":"A BDS graduate can pursue postgraduate specialization in areas such as:"},{"type":"h","text":"Prosthodontics"},{"type":"h","text":"Conservative Dentistry & Endodontics"},{"type":"h","text":"Oral & Maxillofacial Surgery"},{"type":"h","text":"Periodontology"},{"type":"h","text":"Orthodontics"},{"type":"h","text":"Pediatric & Preventive Dentistry"},{"type":"h","text":"Oral Medicine & Radiology"},{"type":"h","text":"Oral Pathology"},{"type":"h","text":"Public Health Dentistry"},{"type":"p","text":"For a government-career orientation, Public Health Dentistry can be particularly relevant for population-level oral 